# Vulkan-Voxy

Vulkan 3D voxel engine using Voxy (LWJGL-based). LOD pipeline with 7-stage compute-based mesh generation. C++ style systems architecture translated to Java with LWJGL.

## Stack
- Java, LWJGL 3, Vulkan
- Gradle build system
- Custom GLSL shaders for compute and rendering

## Key Conventions
- LOD pipeline: 7 stages from voxel data to rendered mesh
- GPU synchronization with explicit barriers
- C++-style systems architecture (data-oriented)
- All GPU resources managed through LWJGL bindings
